In Sporkhack Magicbane is the only weapon that causes screams of
terror from monsters who aren't on their last legs.

This is no big deal for Rogues, but can annoy some other classes.

So the main drawback to using Magicbane instead of a non-artifact
weapon is that it's the most terrifying weapon in the game.

If you can't handle that kind of power then either don't wish for it,
or go back to Vanilla.

